# [[.Name]]

An [Astrona](https://cli.astrona.io) lab.

```sh
astrona run -c .            # start it
astrona docs question       # read the task
astrona submit --watch      # live feedback while you work
astrona submit              # record an attempt
astrona destroy -c .        # clean up
```

Authoring: `astrona validate -c .` checks the config; `astrona test -c .` proves the reference solution in `solution/` passes every check. `.github/workflows/lab.yml` runs both on every pull request. Before enabling it, review the CLI terms and set the repository variable `ASTRONA_SETTINGS_REVIEW_ID` from the settings view shown by the workflow. The ID must match its saved choices; inspect changes before updating it. See https://cli.astrona.io/guides/ci-integration/.
